WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.568
Like the sweet morning dew,

00:00:17.635 --> 00:00:21.049
I took one look at you

00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:25.152
and it was plain to see

00:00:25.635 --> 00:00:29.120
you were my destiny.

00:00:32.593 --> 00:00:35.174
With my arms open wide,

00:00:35.174 --> 00:00:37.141
I threw away my pride.

00:00:37.714 --> 00:00:39.816
I'll sacrifice for you,

00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:42.525
dedicate my life to you,

00:00:42.525 --> 00:00:44.784
I will go where you lead,

00:00:44.784 --> 00:00:47.516
always there in time of need,

00:00:47.516 --> 00:00:50.022
and when I lose my will,

00:00:50.022 --> 00:00:52.319
you'll be there to push
me up the hill.

00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:57.127
There's no,
no looking back for us.

00:00:57.678 --> 00:00:59.282
We got love,

00:00:59.282 --> 00:01:02.087
sure enough, that's enough.

00:01:02.087 --> 00:01:07.314
You're all,
all that I need,

00:01:07.314 --> 00:01:13.001
all that I need.

00:01:14.181 --> 00:01:17.648
All that I need

00:01:18.548 --> 00:01:22.083
to get by.

